  "body": "Apparently `textBaseline` is not interoperable. Firefox implements the HTML Standard, but at least Chrome and Safari do not.\r\n\r\nBugs:\r\n\r\n* https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=737852\r\n* https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=607053\r\n\r\nQuestions:\r\n\r\n* What is the desirable behavior?\r\n* Do we have web-platform-tests?",
